      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this should be \"refs/for/refs/heads/cros/firmware-corsola-15194.B-main\".\n\nSee https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/access-control.html#category_push_merge in particular:\n\n```\nThe reference name connected to a Push Merge Commit entry must always be prefixed with refs/for/, ...\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "85f1bb8ab9d01da12bb0e8b09e53a59352c86ea7",
